 zation] 3DV 2027 - Abstract registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on 3D Vision\nWebsit
 e: https://3dvconf.github.io/2027/\nSource URL: https://3dvconf.github.io
 /2027/\nLocation: Thessaloniki\, Greece\nTopics: Computer Vision & Patter
 n Recognition\, Computer Graphics & Visualization\, Signal Processing\nSi
 ze: M\nSubmission type: Paper-based / OpenReview\nConfidence: confirmed\n
 Last checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: The official site confirms Thessalo
 niki and identical abstract/paper cutoffs at 23:59 AoE. Its archive docum
 ents recent annual editions. CCF has a direct 3DV entry\, but no direct I
 CORE2026 rank was found. M is an editorial size estimate\, not measured a
 ttendance.\nScope: Three-dimensional computer vision and graphics\, espec
 ially sensing\, geometric modeling and representations\, reconstruction\,
  analysis\, rendering\, and visualization. It is a focused venue for reco
 vering and understanding 3D structure rather than all of computer vision.
  Papers combine geometric\, imaging\, and computational methods\; unrelat
 ed applications and every possible ML technique are not added as separate
  scope tags.\nAdditional topics: \nScope sources (2027): https://3dvconf.
 github.io/2027/\, https://3dvconf.github.io/2027/author-guidelines/\nScop
